own/it-asset-management/saas-license-management/integrate-with-miro-enterprise.md","line":308},{"title":"software models","target":"c_CreatingSoftwareModels","line":326},{"title":"Subscription exclusions for SaaS and SSO applications","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/saas-license-management/subscription-exclusions.md","line":338},{"title":"Create a child alias to set up multiple integration profiles","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/saas-license-management/create-child-alias-saas.md","line":340},{"title":"Review a software reclamation rule","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/saas-license-management/add-reclamation-rule-sub.md","line":342},{"title":"Create entitlements in Software Asset Management classic","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/software-asset-management/track-software-rights.md","line":346},{"title":"Create entitlements in workspace","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/software-asset-management/create-entitlements-workspace.md","line":347},{"title":"Create entitlements using the guided walk-through","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/software-asset-management/guidedwalk-workspace.md","line":348},{"title":"License Workbench","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/software-asset-management/sam-license-workbench.md","line":350},{"title":"License usage view","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/software-asset-management/sam-workspace-workbench.md","line":350},{"title":"Run software reconciliation in Software Asset Management classic","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/software-asset-management/t_RunReconciliation.md","line":352},{"title":"Run software reconciliation in the workspace","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/software-asset-management/run-recon-workspace.md","line":353},{"title":"Software Asset Management","target":"c_SoftwareAssetMgmt","line":357},{"title":"SaaS License Management","target":"sam-subscription-management","line":358},{"title":"Using Software Asset Workspace","target":"using-sam-workspace","line":359},{"title":"Software Asset Workspace","target":"sam-workspace","line":360},{"title":"Software models","target":"c_CreatingSoftwareModels","line":361}],"metadata":{"title":"Integrating with Miro Enterprise","description":"Integrating your Software Asset Management application with the Miro Enterprise application enables you to track your software subscriptions and to reclaim unused licenses.Create a Miro Enterprise OAuth 2.0 application to enable access to the Miro API.Enable SCIM \\(System for Cross-domain Identity Management\\) on your Miro Enterprise account so that you can generate an API access token for authenticating your Miro API requests.Create a Miro Enterprise integration profile to track software subscriptions and optimize licensing for your Miro Enterprise applications.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/it-asset-management/saas-license-management/integrate-with-miro-enterprise.html","release":"australia","product":"SaaS License Management","classification":"saas-license-management","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":10,"breadcrumb":["Integrate with SaaS applications","SaaS License Management","Software Asset Management","IT Asset Management"],"tags":["#it-asset-management","#saas","#license-ma